y":"root","cn":"徽标","en":"Badge","desc":"整体，通常附着在相关元素上","desc_en":"The whole badge, usually attached to a related element"},{"key":"anchor","cn":"宿主元素","en":"Host","desc":"被标记的图标、头像或文字","desc_en":"The icon, avatar, or text the badge is attached to"},{"key":"count","cn":"角标","en":"Count","desc":"数字或红点，超 99 一般显示 99+","desc_en":"A number or red dot; counts above 99 usually display as 99+"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"数字徽标","en":"Count","demo":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">🔔</span><span class=\"b-num\">5</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">🔔</span><span class=\"b-num\">5</span></span>","when":"有几条未读要交代清楚时","when_en":"When you have a few unread items that you want to explain clearly"},{"cn":"小红点","en":"Dot","demo":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">⚙️</span><span class=\"b-dot\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">⚙️</span><span class=\"b-dot\"></span></span>","when":"只说“有新内容”,不必报数时","when_en":"When you only need to indicate that there is new content"},{"cn":"状态点","en":"Status","demo":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">林</span><span class=\"b-status\"></span></span><span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"b-status off\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">A</span><span class=\"b-status\"></span></span><span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">M</span><span class=\"b-status off\"></span></span>","when":"标记在线、离开这类实时状态","when_en":"When an online or offline state should be visible at a glance"},{"cn":"封顶数字","en":"Overflow","demo":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">✉️</span><span class=\"b-num\">99+</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">✉️</span><span class=\"b-num\">99+</span></span>","when":"未读数量超过显示上限时，使用封顶数字","when_en":"When the number of unread items exceeds the display upper limit, use the cap number."}],"use":[{"t":"<b>未读消息数</b>：铃铛、私信入口","m":"badge-unread"},{"t":"<b>在线 / 离线</b>状态小圆点","m":"badge-status"},{"t":"<b>标签页、菜单</b>上的待办条数","m":"badge-tab"},{"t":"<b>头像右上角</b>的新动态提示","m":"badge-avatar"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>大数字指标</b>，如销售额、用户数：使用 {c:statistic}","m":"stat-dashboard"},{"t":"用红点作为<b>分类标签</b>：会混淆颜色语义","m":"badge-tag","bad":true},{"t":"大量元素都显示红点：用户难以区分真正重要的提醒","m":"badge-mess","bad":true},{"t":"需要<b>说明具体内容</b>的提醒：使用 {c:notification}","m":"toast-notif"}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"顶部消息入口有 3 条未读消息，既要节省空间，也要让读屏用户知道完整状态。怎样呈现？","options":[{"id":"attached-accessible-badge","label":"在消息入口旁附加数字徽标，并提供“3 条未读消息”的可访问说明","feedback":"徽标补充入口的数量状态，可访问说明则让不依赖视觉的人获得同样信息。","correct":true},{"id":"standalone-statistic","label":"在导航栏中加入一张统计卡，显示“未读消息总数：3”","feedback":"统计卡会占用远多于状态提示所需的空间，也割裂了数量与消息入口的关系。","correct":false},{"id":"color-dot-only","label":"只在消息图标右上角放一个红点，不提供数字或文字","feedback":"红点能提示发生了变化，却不能表达数量，依赖颜色的用户也可能无法获得完整状态。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"The top message entry has three unread messages. It must stay compact and expose the full state to screen-reader users. How should it appear?","options":[{"id":"attached-accessible-badge","label":"Attach a numeric badge to the message entry and expose 3 unread messages accessibly","feedback":"The badge supplements the entry with a compact count, while the accessible description provides the same information nonvisually.","correct":true},{"id":"standalone-statistic","label":"Add a navigation statistic card that reads Total unread messages: 3","feedback":"A statistic card consumes much more space than this status needs and separates the count from the message entry.","correct":false},{"id":"color-dot-only","label":"Show only a red dot on the message icon with no number or text","feedback":"A dot signals change but cannot communicate quantity, and color alone does not provide the complete state.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请在消息入口右上角增加未读数字徽标，并让辅助技术读到“消息，3 条未读”。数量为 0 时不显示徽标，超过上限时显示 99+；测试数字变化不会挤动导航布局。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Add an unread-count badge to the message entry and expose Messages, 3 unread to assistive technology. Hide the badge at zero, show 99+ above the cap, and verify count changes do not shift the navigation layout."}},"references":[{"title":"Badges 徽标","source":"Material Design","url":"https://m3.material.io/components/badges/overview","title_en":"Badges"}],"scenes":["未读消息提醒","在线状态","菜单待办数","购物车数量"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Unread count","m":"badge-unread"},{"t":"New-content marker","m":"badge-status"},{"t":"Online or offline state","m":"badge-tab"},{"t":"Small status attached to an icon or label","m":"badge-avatar"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use a badge as the main content","m":"stat-dashboard"},{"t":"Show a large number that no longer fits","m":"badge-tag","bad":true},{"t":"Rely on a colored dot with no accessible text","m":"badge-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Attach several badges to the same small target","m":"toast-notif"}],"scenes":["Inbox count","Notification icon","Online avatar","New tab"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px\">\n      <b style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--brand)\">VibeHub</b>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Components</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Tutorials</span>\n      <span style=\"flex:1\"></span>\n      <span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">🔔</span><span class=\"b-num\">5</span></span>\n      <span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">✉️</span><span class=\"b-num\">99+</span></span>\n      <span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:url('/assets/avatar-fox.png') center/cover\"></span>\n    </div>","<div class=\"list-demo\" style=\"max-width:300px\">\n      <div class=\"list-item\"><span class=\"badge-d\"><